==Battleground==
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] (150%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] (150%) spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] (150%) spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to defeat the Gories. For the Metal Hippoe, either use fast attackers such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitters]] such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]].

